  "question": {
    "text": "The value of $\\lim _{n \\rightarrow \\infty}\\left[\\frac{n}{n^2+1^2}+\\frac{n}{n^2+2^2}+\\ldots \\ldots . . \\frac{n}{n^2+n^2}\\right]$ is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{\\pi}{4}$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\log 2$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "zero",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "1",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\text { Hints : } \\lim _{n \\rightarrow \\infty}\\left[\\frac{n}{n^2+1^2}+\\frac{n}{n^2+2^2}+\\ldots+\\frac{n}{n^2+n^2}\\right]\n$$\n\n$$\n=\\lim _{n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\sum_{r=1}^n \\frac{n}{n^2+r^2}=\\lim _{n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\frac{1}{n} \\sum_{r=1}^n \\frac{1}{1+\\left(\\frac{r}{n}\\right)^2}=\\int_0^1 \\frac{d x}{1+x^2}=\\left[\\tan ^{-1} x\\right]_0^1=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\n$$"
  }
}